  i In Vue 3, each property of $slots is a function that returns the content of the slot, so reading or iterating it directly doesn't work.
  
  i Call the slot to get its content, for example this.$slots.default().
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

